h cutting-edge VR technology, experience different flooding scenarios and see how engineering and community-driven strategies can build a more resilient future.", "short_description": "Rising Tides: Miami\u2019s Future is an immersive Meta Quest experience exploring Miami\u2019s fight against hurricanes, flooding, and sea-level rise. Visit Little Havana, Brickell, and Virginia Key to witness the impact and discover real-world solutions."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtualplanet.tech/privacy-policy-app", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Planet Technologies", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://virtualplanet.tech/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es_MX"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26765650896411567"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "890633939720563"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "890633939720563"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1751980800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "890633939720563"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "30102329376077019", "version": "0.3"}, "id": "1273079030350306", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidB